#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "Lugha Reference API"
msgstr "API ya Marejeleo ya Lugha"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"Lugha is a small text generation API that supports African languages. Use"
" it to generate text, count tokens before you send a request, and choose "
"the region that processes your data."
msgstr ""
"Lugha ni API ndogo ya kutengeneza maandishi inayotumia lugha za Afrika. "
"Itumie kutengeneza maandishi, kuhesabu tokeni kabla ya kutuma ombi, na "
"kuchagua eneo linalochakata data yako."

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid "Independent documentation exercise"
msgstr "Zoezi huru la uwekaji wa nyaraka"

#: ../../index.md:8
msgid ""
"Lugha is not a real product. It is a reference API written to show how I "
"document an AI inference service for developers. The model is a stub that"
" returns predictable text, so every example on these pages runs and "
"returns exactly what is shown."
msgstr ""
"Lugha si bidhaa halisi. Ni API ya marejeleo iliyoandikwa kuonyesha jinsi "
"ninavyoandika nyaraka za huduma ya uelekezaji wa AI kwa wasanidi programu. "
"Muundo huu ni stub unaorudisha maandishi yanayotabirika, hivyo kila mfano "
"kwenye kurasa hizi huendeshwa na kurudisha kile kinachoonyeshwa."

#: ../../index.md:11
msgid "Start here"
msgstr "Anza hapa"

#: ../../index.md:16
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "Mwanzo wa haraka"

#: ../../index.md:20
msgid "Make your first request in about five minutes."
msgstr "Tuma ombi lako la kwanza ndani ya takribani dakika tano."

#: ../../index.md:23
msgid "Handle errors"
msgstr "Shughulikia hitilafu"

#: ../../index.md:27
msgid ""
"Every error has a type, a message and a request ID. Learn what to do with"
" each one."
msgstr ""
"Kila hitilafu ina aina, ujumbe na kitambulisho cha ombi. Jifunze cha kufanya "
"kwa kila mojawapo."

#: ../../index.md:30
msgid "Go to production"
msgstr "Nenda kwenye uzalishaji"

#: ../../index.md:34
msgid "A checklist to work through before you ship."
msgstr "Orodha ya ukaguzi ya kufuata kabla ya kuchapisha."

#: ../../index.md:37
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Marejeleo ya API"

#: ../../index.md:41
msgid "Every endpoint, parameter and response."
msgstr "Kila endpoint, kigezo na jibu."